Hello everyone,

I just found the dumps of my three ascensions tucked away in an obscure 
directory, so I thought I could do some bragging. ;-) Unfortunately they are 
all dated '2008-05-12' which must be the day I copied them from my old 
system.

I ascended three times: samurai, rogue and barbarian (in that order) and 
couldn't even remember the barbarian ascension. I just remember that my plan 
to ascend every class ended with valkyries. In all games, I did not use 
'Elbereth' a single time because it just doesn't feel right. I was too lazy 
to recompile though and thus indirectly profited from the two (or three?) 
pre-generated 'Elbereth' graffiti. Also, I went practically pet-free, 
because they are so annoying (i.e. I left them behind as quickly as 
possible).

Judging from the dumps, I only ascend when I find the correct altar right 
away. :-o

Anyway, here are the dumps, enjoy!

